    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。現在最有效的辦法，就是拆除核心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失去了控制和引擎的飛空艇才有被阻止的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
